Here you can find links to a number of digitised sources that were created by the “Verein”.

1. A complete set of the “Mittheilungen des Museen-Verbandes“ (the internal journal): [https://digi.ub.uni-heidelberg.de/diglit/mitmusverb](https://digi.ub.uni-heidelberg.de/diglit/mitmusverb) 

2. A complete set of the “Verhandlungen” (the protocols of the yearly internal meetings): [https://digi.ub.uni-heidelberg.de/diglit/verhversverbmb](https://digi.ub.uni-heidelberg.de/diglit/verhversverbmb)

3. The last list (1936) of the members of the “Verein”: [https://doi.org/10.11588/diglit.43135#0001](https://doi.org/10.11588/diglit.43135#0001)
